-- A 2005 music player skin: brushed aluminium, a glowing green LCD, chrome transport buttons, an aqua play button,
-- glossy window lights, a striped playlist. Lit, not flat: the metal catches the light as the piece tilts.
Let there be a canvas called player-skin, 1600 by 1000, from aluminium.
Brush the card at 0 degrees.

-- the window
Let there be a rectangle called body, 1520 by 920, corners 34, at 800 500.
Make the body #d9dce1.
Give the body an outline in #8d939c, 3 wide.
Let there be a rectangle called titlebar, 1520 by 70, corners 34, at 800 75.
Make the titlebar a gradient from #f4f5f7 to #b9bec6, angled 90.
Write "Morgana Player" called title in Jost bold, at 800 88, size 30.
Make the title #3a3f47.
Give the title a shadow, 1 down, blur 0, in #ffffff, 90% opacity.

-- window lights
Let there be 3 circles called light, 13 big, in a row, 36 apart, from 80 75.
Make the first light a radial gradient from #ff8a80 to #c62828.
Make the second light a radial gradient from #ffe082 to #f9a825.
Make the third light a radial gradient from #a5d6a7 to #2e7d32.
Give the lights an outline in #00000055, 1 wide.
Give the lights an inner shadow, 3 up, blur 4, in #ffffff, 60% opacity.

-- the LCD
Let there be a rectangle called lcd, 760 by 210, corners 18, at 800 245.
Make the lcd a gradient from #d8e8b8 to #a9c47f, angled 90.
Give the lcd an inner shadow, 6 down, blur 14, 55% opacity.
Give the lcd an outline in #6d7a5a, 2 wide.
Write "LANTERNS" called song in Martian Mono, at 445 210, size 42, tracking 4, aligned left.
Write "Vesper Lane — Ember Season" called artist in Martian Mono, at 447 255, size 22, aligned left.
Write "2:41" called elapsed in Martian Mono, at 445 320, size 22, aligned left.
Write "-1:26" called remaining in Martian Mono, at 1155 320, size 22, aligned right.
Make the song, the artist, the elapsed and the remaining #27331a.
Let there be a rectangle called track, 560 by 10, corners 5, at 800 313.
Let there be a rectangle called played, 365 by 10, corners 5, at 702 313.
Make the track #27331a, 80% see-through.
Make the played #27331a.
Let there be 8 rectangles called eq, 10 by 44, in a row, 16 apart, from 1062 225.
Make the eqs #27331a, 25% see-through.
Make every other eq #27331a.

-- album art
Let there be a rectangle called art, 200 by 200, corners 10, at 250 245.
Print @hallows.jpg in the art, focused at 0.33 0.42.
Give the art a shadow, 8 down, blur 18, 50% opacity.
Give the art an outline in #ffffff, 3 wide.

-- transport: chrome buttons, aqua play
Let there be a circle called prev, 46 big, at 1270 245.
Let there be a circle called next, 46 big, at 1500 245.
Let there be a circle called play, 62 big, at 1385 245.
Make the prev mirror chrome.
Make the next mirror chrome.
Emboss the prev, 0.25 mm high, soft 0.6.
Emboss the next, 0.25 mm high, soft 0.6.
Make the play a radial gradient from #a7dcff to #1565c0.
Give the play an outline in #0d3c78, 2 wide.
Emboss the play, 0.35 mm high, soft 0.5.
Spray the play with gloss, 40 µm thick.
Let there be a triangle called play-icon, 22 big, at 1389 245.
Make the play-icon turned 90.
Make the play-icon #ffffff.
Let there be a triangle called prev-icon, 13 big, at 1264 245.
Make the prev-icon turned -90.
Make the prev-icon #3a3f47.
Let there be a triangle called next-icon, 13 big, at 1506 245.
Make the next-icon turned 90.
Make the next-icon #3a3f47.

-- volume
Let there be a rectangle called groove, 300 by 10, corners 5, at 1385 340.
Deboss the groove, 0.06 mm deep.
Make the groove #8d939c.
Let there be a circle called knob, 17 big, at 1460 340.
Make the knob mirror chrome.
Emboss the knob, 0.3 mm high, soft 0.5.

-- the playlist
Let there be a rectangle called list, 1440 by 470, corners 14, at 800 655.
Make the list #ffffff.
Give the list an inner shadow, 3 down, blur 8, 40% opacity.
Let there be 8 rectangles called row, 1436 by 54, in a column, 56 apart, from 800 452.
Make every other row #edf3fb.
Let there be a rectangle called now, 1436 by 54, at 800 564.
Make the now a gradient from #4a90e2 to #2a6fc4, angled 90.
Write "1\n2\n\n4\n5\n6" called nums in Jost, at 110 599, size 24, leading 2.333, aligned left.
Write "Lanterns\nHollow\n\nPaper Moon\nCandle Hour\nLate October" called names in Jost, at 160 599, size 24, leading 2.333, aligned left.
Write "Vesper Lane\nVesper Lane\n\nVesper Lane\nVesper Lane\nVesper Lane" called artists in Jost, at 900 599, size 24, leading 2.333, aligned left.
Write "4:07\n3:52\n\n3:38\n4:21\n2:59" called times in Jost, at 1480 599, size 24, leading 2.333, aligned right.
Write "3" called now-num in Jost, at 110 574, size 24, aligned left.
Write "Ember Season" called now-name in Jost bold, at 160 574, size 24, aligned left.
Write "Vesper Lane" called now-artist in Jost, at 900 574, size 24, aligned left.
Write "5:10" called now-time in Jost, at 1480 574, size 24, aligned right.
Make the nums, the names, the artists and the times #2b3036.
Make the now-num, the now-name, the now-artist and the now-time #ffffff.

-- status bar
Write "6 songs · 24.1 minutes · 58.3 MB" called status in Jost, at 800 948, size 22.
Make the status #5b616a.
Engrave the status, 0.02 mm deep.
